    </section>

    <section class="intro-section">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-center text-blue-600 mb-1">Connecting India's Workforce, Empowering Futures</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-center">ShramSetu is driven by a vision to create a more equitable and efficient employment landscape in India. We believe in the power of connection and are committed to providing a platform that benefits both skilled individuals and businesses seeking talent.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="our-mission-section">
      <div class="mission-vision-content">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>To empower India's workforce by building a user-friendly and reliable platform that seamlessly connects skilled individuals with diverse job opportunities, fostering economic growth and personal development.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="our-vision-section">
      <div class="mission-vision-content">
        <h2>Our Vision</h2>
        <p>To be the leading and most trusted national platform for workforce connection, recognized for its positive impact on employment rates, economic empowerment, and the overall prosperity of India.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

